taurants.html\">中式</a>\n    <a href=\"restaurants.html\">西式</a>\n    <a href=\"restaurants.html\">甜品</a>\n    <a href=\"restaurants.html\">饮品</a>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"featured\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/260x150/ffcc99/333\" alt=\"味满园\">\n        <h3>味满园</h3>\n        <p>地道四川小吃，香辣鲜香</p>\n        <p>人均：30-80元</p>\n        <a href=\"restaurant.html\">查看菜单</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/260x150/99ccff/333\" alt=\"北极星披萨\">\n        <h3>北极星披萨</h3>\n        <p>手工薄底披萨，多种配料</p>\n        <p>人均：50-120元</p>\n        <a href=\"restaurant.html\">查看菜单</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n        <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/260x150/ff9999/333\" alt=\"甜品屋\">\n        <h3>甜品屋</h3>\n        <p>精致蛋糕与手作甜点</p>\n        <p>人均：20-60元</p>\n        <a href=\"restaurant.html\">查看菜单</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n    <p>© 2025 快送外卖 · 成都配送服务</p>\n    <p>联系电话：138-0011-2233</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>关于我们 - 快送外卖</title>\n<style>\n    body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n    .container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;}\n    header{background:#004d40;color:#fff;padding:15px 0;text-align:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;}\n    nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin:0 15px;font-weight:bold;}\n    .about{background:#fff;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n    .about h2{margin-top:0;color:#004d40;}\n    footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;text-align:center;padding:15px 0;margin-top:40px;}\n    @media (max-width:768px){\n        .container{padding:10px;}\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n    <h1>关于我们</h1>\n    <nav>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n        <a href=\"restaurants.html\">餐厅列表</a>\n        <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n    </nav>\n</header>\n\n<section class=\"about\">\n    <h2>快送外卖简介</h2>\n    <p>快送外卖成立于2020年，专注于为成都的学生和上班族提供快速、安全、健康的外卖配送服务。我们与本地知名餐厅合作，确保每一份餐点都新鲜、味美，并通过专业的配送团队在30分钟内送达。</p>\n    <p>我们的服务覆盖成都市区及周边区县，包括武侯区、青羊区、金牛区等。无论是忙碌的上班族还是在校的学生，都能通过我们的平台轻松下单，享受美食。</p>\n    <p>我们坚持以下几个原则：<strong>快速</strong>、<strong>准时</strong>、<strong>健康</strong>、<strong>高性价比</strong>。通过不断优化配送路线和提升技术支持，我们致力于让每一次外卖都成为一次愉悦的体验。</p>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n    <p>© 2025 快送外卖 · 成都配送服务</p>\n    <p>联系电话：138-0011-2233</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: restaurants.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>餐厅列表 - 快送外卖</title>\n<style>\n    body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n    .container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;}\n    header{background:#004d40;color:#fff;padding:15px 0;text-align:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;}\n    nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin:0 15px;font-weight:bold;}\n    .list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;justify-content:center;}\n    .restaurant-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;width:260px;padding:15px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n    .restaurant-card img{width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:cover;margin-bottom:10px;}\n    .restaurant-card h3{margin:10px 0;font-size:1.2em;}\n    .restaurant-card p{font-size:0.9em;color:#666;margin-bottom:10px;}\n    .restaurant-card a{background:#28a745;color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;}\n    footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;text-align:center;padding:15px 0;margin-top:40px;}\n    @media (max-width:768px){\n        .container{padding:10px;}\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"container\">\n<header>\n    <h1>餐厅列表</h1>\n    <nav>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n        <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n        <a href=\"order_confirm.html\">订单确认</a>\n    </nav>\n</header>\n\n<section class=\"list\">\n    <div class=\"restaurant-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/260x150/ffcc99/333\" alt=\"味满园\">\n        <h3>味满园</h3>\n        <p>四川经典小吃，香辣鲜香</p>\n        <p>人均：30-80元</p>\n        <a href=\"restaurant.html\">查看菜单</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"restaurant-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/260x150/99ccff/333\" alt=\"北极星披萨\">\n        <h3>北极星披萨</h3>\n        <p>手工薄底披萨，多种配料</p>\n        <p>人均：50-120元</p>\n        <a href=\"restaurant.html\">查看菜单</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"restaurant-card\">\n        <img src=\"https://via.placeholder.com/260x150/ff9999/333\" alt=\"甜品屋\">\n        <h3>甜品屋</h3>\n        <p>精致蛋糕与手作甜点</p>\n        <p>人均：20-60元</p>\n        <a href=\"restaurant.html\">查看菜单</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<footer>\n    <p>© 2025 快送外卖 · 成都配送服务</p>\n    <p>联系电话：138-0011-2233</p>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n===== FILE: restaurant.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>味满园 - 菜单详情</title>\n<style>\n    body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;color:#333;background:#f9f9f9;}\n    .container{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px;}\n    header{background:#004d40;color:#fff;padding:15px 0;text-align:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10;}\n    nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin:0 15px;font-weight:bold;}\n    .menu{background:#fff;padding:30px;box-shadow:0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);}\n    .menu h2{margin-top:0;color:#004d40;}\n    .item{margin-bottom:20px;}\n    .item h3{margin:0 0 5px;color:#d35400;}\n    .item p{margin:0 0 5px;color:#555;}\n    .price{font-weight:bold;color:#e74c3c;}\n    .quantity{width:60px;}\n    .btn{background:#28a745;color:#fff;padding:10px 15px;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:10px;}\n    footer{background:#222;color:#ccc;text-align:center;padding:15px 0;margin-top:40px;}\n    @media (max-width:768px){\n        .contai